  "lyrics": "[Verse]\nThere's a bridge beside the water\nWhere the willow branches lean\nAnd the boats return at sundown\nFrom the places we have seen\n\n[Chorus]\nSet a lantern on the river\nLet it carry what we know\nAll the words we never managed\nAll the things we couldn't show\n\n[Verse]\nYou were humming in the kitchen\nWith the window open wide\nAnd the summer kept a promise\nIn the turning of the tide\n\n[Chorus]\nSet a lantern on the river\nLet it carry what we know\nAll the words we never managed\nAll the things we couldn't show\n\n[Outro]\nWhen the morning finds the water\nWe will let the lantern go",
